BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 674.00 Td (Recommended Production Hardening) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.80 Tf 54.00 652.00 Td (If this component model is promoted into a real product, prioritize the following changes:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 634.80 Td (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 623.00 Td (Replace mock SDK code with adapters around the real ALSA/tinyalsa, Opus, MP3, Voice/VAD, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 611.20 Td (UniSound APIs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 596.40 Td (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 584.60 Td (Replace lightweight JSON scanning with a structured parser.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 569.80 Td (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 558.00 Td (Define a stable wire protocol: byte order, packet framing, version, checksum or length validation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 546.20 Td (and error responses.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 531.40 Td (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 519.60 Td (Add timeout, retry, reconnect, and partial-read/partial-write handling for network code.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 504.80 Td (5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 493.00 Td (Add structured logs and real log rotation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 478.20 Td (6.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.40 Tf 78.00 466.40 Td (Move secrets such as ASR app keys out of source and into secure configuration.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.40 Tf 62.00 451.60 Td (7.) Tj ET
